4,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of reinventing the wheel. We need to check the closure reports from the last decade.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. But first, I need to know if we actually have the bodies to run these new routes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I worry we fix what’s loud, not what’s slow. I want to see the journey audits.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I’ve seen plans die in committee rooms, not on tracks. I need to see the joint operators' minutes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’m concerned about the long tail of costs. I want to look at the ticketing contractor fees.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, if the roster books are empty, the best plan is just a brochure.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. I’ll check the roster books for the late-turn pool to see who’s actually available.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, if the committee is stuck, the plan is stuck. I hope the minutes are clear.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I hope so too. I’ll also look at the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll also examine the balances in the capital ledger to see what’s already committed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I’m going to look into the two pilots from eight years ago. They’re the closest thing to a test case.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll also check the crew establishment and maintenance contract. It defines the hard limits of our capacity.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll also look at the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city. I need to verify the crowding complaints.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I’m content with my choices. The past is the best predictor of the future’s delays.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I’m content as well. Knowing the debt is knowing the risk.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Let’s see what the ghosts have to say before we invite new ones in.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I prefer to know the weight of the load before we ask the mules to pull it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I just want to know where the minutes actually go, not where people think they go.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I just want to know who has to nod before we can move a single stone.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I just want to know what we owe before we promise to pay more.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
